  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Beslutet g&#xe4;ller anlitande av en konsult f&#xf6;r f&#xf6;rfattandet av ett Terms of reference f&#xf6;r ett kommande handelskammarsamarbete. Konsulten ska &#xe4;ven bist&#xe5; mottagarparten Ukrainian Chamber of Commerce and Industry i att upphandla den svenska konsulten som ska utf&#xf6;ra projektet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The decision regards hiring a consultant to write a Terms of Reference of a future chamber of commerce co-operation. The  consultant will also assist the ukrainian party Ukrainian Chamber of Commerce and Industry in choosing the consultant who will carry out the future project.</narrative>
  </description>
